Qwen3.5 vision candidate adapter uses the MIT-licensed, lab-owned mlx-vlm
source at commit 8a5e704e0fe43cd8654c144c4ecbd4c8aececeb5. The model,
processor, image/video generation, and optional MTP verification remain in
that pinned runtime. mlx2 adds artifact gates and a direct candidate wrapper;
no source implementation was copied into the new adapter.
